ill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Faster iteration between feedback and the next version</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Less time spent on repetitive coding</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Rapid experimentation with alternative approaches</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">More efficient development workflows on well-defined tasks</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="limitations" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">Limitations we are honest about</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">AI-assisted coding is useful, not magic. Used without review it introduces real problems, and pretending otherwise would be misleading.</p><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:132:13"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:133:31">What can go wrong without oversight</h3><ul class="space-y-2" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:134:15"><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Incorrect code that looks plausible but does the wrong thing</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Security issues, such as weak validation or exposed credentials</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Bugs in edge cases that were never described in the instruction</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Inefficient implementations that do not scale with real data</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Misunderstood requirements, where the output solves a different problem</span></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-xl border-l-4 border-amber bg-amber/10 p-5" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:240:11"><p class="font-display font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:241:13">Review and testing are not optional</p><p class="mt-1 text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:242:13">Every AI-assisted change goes through developer review and testing before it reaches a live site. That step is what makes the speed usable.</p></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-14" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/PageTemplate.tsx:136:13"><div id="faqs" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:289:5"><h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:290:7">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card px-5" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:293:7" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="border-b" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:295:11"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex" data-tsd-source="/src/components/ui/accordion.tsx:21:3"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_3diiq_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 cursor-pointer transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-display text-base font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:296:13" data-radix-collection-item="">What is vibe coding?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stro